msgid "4. Healing & Co-op"
msgstr "4. 复苏与合作"

#: ui.lua:30
msgid "How to revive wilted plants, avoid overcrowding, and play with friends."
msgstr "如何复苏枯萎植物、避免地面拥挤，以及与好友同乐。"

#: ui.lua:33
msgid "5. Top 10 Scores"
msgstr "5. 前 10 排行"

#: ui.lua:34
msgid "See the highest levels reached and best runs saved on this world."
msgstr "查看本世界保存的最高闯关数与最佳挑战成绩。"

#: ui.lua:41
msgid "WELCOME TO THE WIZARD'S GLASS TERRARIUM!"
msgstr "欢迎来到巫师的玻璃生态瓶！"

#: ui.lua:44
msgid "You have been shrunk down inside an open-top glass box on a wizard's wooden desk."
msgstr "你被缩小放进了巫师木书桌上一只敞口玻璃生态箱里。"

#: ui.lua:48
msgid "Glowing rings appear on the soil before fire, ice, acid, or chalk blocks drop in from above — clear them on the floor with Tools [1–4], or catch them in mid-air for extra plant growth!"
msgstr "火、冰、酸、白垩方块从上方落下前，土壤上会出现发光预警圈——落地后用工具 [1–4] 清理，或在半空直接拦截以赢取额外生长！"

#: ui.lua:54
msgid "✦ YOUR GOAL: GROW EVERY PLANT TO 100% BLOOM"
msgstr "✦ 你的目标：培育所有植物达到 100% 开花"

#: ui.lua:57
msgid "Level 1 starts in 1 cozy glass room with charged Tools [2–4] (4 Puffs · 3 Splashes · 4 Sweeps, gaining +1 cap every 2 levels!)."
msgstr "第 1 关从 1 间温馨玻璃房开始，工具 [2–4] 初始满充能（4 次鼓风 · 3 次泼洒 · 4 次清扫，每 2 关容量上限 +1！）。"

#: ui.lua:64
msgid "Reach 100% Bloom with all plants awake to finish the level, pick 1 of 3 Next-Level Blessings, and open a new archway room (plus Level 3+ Trial Waves)!"
msgstr "在所有植物清醒的状态下达到 100% 开花即可过关，随后从 3 项下一关祝福中任选 1 项，并开启新的拱门房间（第 3 关起更有试炼波次）！"

#: ui.lua:70
msgid "✦ KEEP HEAT & SOIL COMFORTABLE"
msgstr "✦ 保持温度与土壤舒适"

#: ui.lua:71
msgid "Heat [40°C – 60°C]"
msgstr "温度 [40°C – 60°C]"

#: ui.lua:72
msgid "Fiery Brimstone makes it hotter; blue Ice makes it colder."
msgstr "炽热硫磺会升温；蓝色寒冰会降温。"

#: ui.lua:73
msgid "Soil pH [5.6 – 8.4]"
msgstr "土壤 pH [5.6 – 8.4]"

#: ui.lua:74
msgid "Green Acid makes soil too sour; Chalk makes soil too dry."
msgstr "绿色酸液会使土壤过酸；白垩会使土壤过碱偏干。"

#: ui.lua:77
msgid "Keep leftover floor hazards low so the garden stays Balanced — plants heal themselves, wilted plants revive after 6s, and 8s of balance gives everyone a Harmony Boost!"
msgstr "及时清理地面残留危害以维持花园平衡——平衡时植物会自动回血，枯萎植物 6 秒后自动复苏，持续平衡 8 秒还会为全员赋予和谐加速！"

#: ui.lua:94
msgid "POINT AT ANY PICTURE · RIGHT-CLICK ANY PLANT!"
msgstr "指向任意图标查看详情 · 右键点击任意植物打开面板！"

#: ui.lua:96
msgid "[1–4] Tools · [5] Guidebook · [I] Quick Guide · [Z] Call Room · [E+W] Sprint."
msgstr "[1–4] 工具 · [5] 图鉴 · [I] 速览 · [Z] 标记房间 · [E+W] 冲刺。"

#: ui.lua:119
msgid "What it does:"
msgstr "方块影响："

#: ui.lua:120
msgid "How to clear:"
msgstr "清理方式："

#: ui.lua:135
msgid "✦ HELPFUL COMBOS & BONUS CRYSTALS"
msgstr "✦ 实用连携与奖励水晶"

#: ui.lua:137
msgid "Combine Hot + Cold with Trowel [1]"
msgstr "用花铲 [1] 合并冷与热"

#: ui.lua:140
msgid "Click Brimstone or Ice with Trowel [1] to scoop it up, then click right onto (or beside) its opposite so both burst into fresh Water & Steam!"
msgstr "用花铲 [1] 点击硫磺或寒冰将其铲起，再直接点击其相克方块（或其旁地面），两者便会化作清水与蒸汽！"

#: ui.lua:146
msgid "Make Green Speed Soil (Acid + Chalk)"
msgstr "制造绿色加速土（酸液 + 白垩）"

#: ui.lua:149
msgid "Clear green Acid with Pestle [4] (or click Chalk onto Acid) to turn brown dirt into glowing Fertile Soil that boosts plant growth and running speed!"
msgstr "用石杵 [4] 清扫酸液（或将白垩配对到酸液上），即可把褐土变成发光的肥沃土壤，同时提升植物生长与奔跑速度！"

#: ui.lua:155
msgid "Prismatic Geodes & 85% Final Surge"
msgstr "棱彩晶洞与 85% 终局狂潮"

#: ui.lua:158
msgid "Click with Trowel [1] within 22s to clear nearby hazards & refill all Tools [2–4]!"
msgstr "22 秒内用花铲 [1] 敲开，即可清除附近危害并回满所有工具 [2–4]！"

#: ui.lua:161
msgid "Refilling Tools [2–4] & Emergency Prime:"
msgstr "补充工具 [2–4] 与应急充能："

#: ui.lua:164
msgid "Siphon Brimstone → Bellows [2], Water/Steam → Flask [3], Chalk → Pestle [4] (or click empty air when empty for +1 emergency charge!)."
msgstr "吸取硫磺 → 风箱 [2]，舀取水/蒸汽 → 水瓶 [3]，研磨白垩 → 石杵 [4]（耗尽时点击空气也可应急充能 +1！）。"

#: ui.lua:173
msgid "✦ SPEED SOIL & RARE ELIXIRS [6–7]"
msgstr "✦ 加速土与珍稀秘药 [6–7]"

#: ui.lua:175
msgid "Extra potions past your belt cap auto-convert into bonus Bloom & healing!"
msgstr "超出腰带上限的额外药水会自动转化为开花度与治疗奖励！"

#: ui.lua:178
msgid "Fertile Speed Soil"
msgstr "肥沃加速土"

#: ui.lua:179
msgid "(Pave Your Own Green Paths!)"
msgstr "（亲手铺设绿色疾行通道！）"

#: ui.lua:182
msgid "Wash Chalk or dust Acid to pave glowing green paths that make you run much faster!"
msgstr "冲洗白垩或中和酸液，铺出让你健步如飞的发光绿径！"

#: ui.lua:185
msgid "Aegis Potion [6]"
msgstr "神盾药水 [6]"

#: ui.lua:186
msgid "(Geodes & Level Clears · Cap 2)"
msgstr "（晶洞与通关获取 · 上限 2）"

#: ui.lua:189
msgid "Refills full health, revives all wilted plants, & shields you + plants for 12s (triggers automatically if you run out of health!)."
msgstr "回满生命、复苏全部枯萎植物，并为你和植物提供 12 秒护盾（生命耗尽时自动触发！）。"

#: ui.lua:195
msgid "Chronos Hourglass [7]"
msgstr "时之沙漏 [7]"

#: ui.lua:196
msgid "(Every Level · Cap 2)"
msgstr "（每关获取 · 上限 2）"

#: ui.lua:199
msgid "Pauses falling blocks for 12s, clears nearby hazards, & speeds up everyone!"
msgstr "暂停方块下落 12 秒，清除附近危害，并为全员提速！"

#: ui.lua:222
msgid "✦ PLANT HEALTH & HOW TO REVIVE"
msgstr "✦ 植物生命与复苏方法"

#: ui.lua:225
msgid "Each room's plant has its own Plant Health (0% – 100%) and natural growth pace:"
msgstr "每间房的植物都有独立的生命值（0% – 100%）与自然生长速度："

#: ui.lua:229
msgid "Extreme heat/cold, sour/chalky soil, or hazards left right next to a plant slowly lower that plant's health."
msgstr "过热/过冷、土壤过酸/过碱，或紧挨植物残留的危害都会逐渐降低该植物的生命值。"

#: ui.lua:236
msgid "At 0% health, a plant WILTS and shows a bright red warning marker on screen so you can find it right away—even through walls!"
msgstr "生命降至 0% 时植物会枯萎，并在屏幕上显示醒目的红色警告标记，隔墙也能一眼定位！"

