msgid "Keep at least 1 plant healthy while you water any wilted ones!"
msgstr "去给枯萎植物浇水时，务必确保至少还有 1 株植物保持健康！"

#: ui.lua:264
msgid "Too Many Uncleared Blocks (8-Second Warning)"
msgstr "未清理方块过多（8 秒警告）"

#: ui.lua:267
msgid "If too many blocks pile up on the floor, an 8s warning counts down — clear a few blocks before time runs out to stay safe!"
msgstr "若地面堆积方块超出上限，将触发 8 秒倒计时警告——赶在读秒结束前清掉几个方块即可化险为夷！"

#: ui.lua:273
msgid "Hazard Burns, Stings & Co-op"
msgstr "危害灼伤、刺痛与多人合作"

#: ui.lua:276
msgid "Standing on Brimstone, wading in Acid Slime, or standing under falling blocks hurts!"
msgstr "踩在硫磺上、蹚进酸液里，或站在下落方块正下方都会受伤！"

#: ui.lua:280
msgid "Solo: 0 HP brings you back in Room 1 (-30% plant HP). Press [Z] to call rooms!"
msgstr "单人：生命归零会在 1 号房复活（植物 -30% 生命）。按 [Z] 可呼叫标记房间！"

